<!-- SETUP 2: PC ÉTUDES -->
<div class="setup-section" id="studies-pc">
<h2>🐧 STUDY PC (Arch Linux)</h2>
<p style="margin-bottom:30px;color:#d8dee9">Recovered old PC running Arch Linux for studies and development</p>

<h3 style="margin:20px 0;color:#88c0d0">💾 Specs (Old Hardware)</h3>
<div class="specs-grid">
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">CPU:</span> Intel Core i3-1115G4</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">GPU:</span> Intel UHD Graphics</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">RAM:</span> 4GB  DDR4-3200</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Storage:</span> 256GB SSD</div>
</div>

<h3 style="margin:30px 0 20px;color:#88c0d0">⚙️ Software</h3>
<div class="specs-grid">
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">OS:</span> Arch Linux</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">DE/WM:</span> Hyprland</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Terminal:</span> Kitty</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Editor:</span> VSCode, Sublime text</div>
<div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Shell:</span> Zsh</div>
</div>

<p style="margin-top:20px;color:#81a1c1">
<strong>Why Arch?</strong> Lightweight, customizable, perfect for learning Linux internals
</p>
</div>
<br>

<div class="setup-section" id="homelab">
    <h2>🖥️ HOMELAB SERVER</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom:30px;color:#d8dee9">Self-hosted services and learning platform</p>

    <div class="specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Infrastructure:</span> Docker & Docker Compose</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">OS:</span> Linux (Ubuntu/Debian)</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Main Service:</span> Jellyfin (Media Server)</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Security:</span> Reverse Proxy, SSL, Firewall configuration</div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:20px;color:#81a1c1">
        <strong>Focus:</strong> Maîtrise de la conteneurisation et sécurisation des accès externes pour un usage personnel fiable.
    </p>
</div>
