</div>
<br>

<div class="setup-section" id="arcade">
    <h2>🕹️ CUSTOM ARCADE MACHINE</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom:30px;color:#d8dee9">Handmade arcade cabinet with Raspberry Pi</p>

    <h3 style="margin:20px 0;color:#88c0d0">💾 Hardware</h3>
    <div class="specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Brain:</span> Raspberry Pi</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Screen:</span> Recovered Monitor (Recycled)</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Controls:</span> Arcade Joystick & Sanwa-style buttons</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Art:</span> 90's Retro Arcade Aesthetic</div>
    </div>

    <h3 style="margin:30px 0 20px;color:#88c0d0">⚙️ Software</h3>
    <div class="specs-grid">
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">OS:</span> EmulationStation / RetroPie</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Emulators:</span> MAME, NeoGeo, SNES</div>
        <div class="spec-item"><span class="spec-label">Players:</span> Solo & Local Multiplayer</div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:20px;color:#81a1c1">
        <strong>Build Story:</strong> Un projet de restauration basé sur la récupération, upgradé pour retrouver les sensations des salles d'arcade des années 90.
    </p>
